        "original_id": "6964003e-d9a8-56f6-b907-ac475a7dbcc2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Smith\n- Organizations: Bastille\n- Products: \"Pompeii\"\n- Topics: music career\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Smith was born on 14 July 1986 and is a British singer-songwriter and record producer.\n- Dan Smith is the lead singer and primary songwriter of Bastille.\n- Bastille formed in 2010.\n- \"Pompeii\" was released as the fourth single from its album on 12 January 2013.\n- Bastille gained mass popularity in 2013 when \"Pompeii\" was released.\n- \"Pompeii\" reached number 2 on the UK Singles Chart, number 4 on the Australian ARIA Chart, number 5 on the US Billboard Hot 100, and number 1 on the Alternative Songs chart.",
